othing about you or what you're doing.</p>\n<p>&quot;Super Intelligence,&quot; to me, is insulting to us humans who do possess actual intelligence (no matter how much) and will always be super when compared to a machine that actually has zero intelligence.</p>\n<p>It's absolutely the wrong way to go. Please do not do this.</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.c-span.org/clip/united-nations/president-trump-renames-ai-to-super-intelligence-and-stresses-importance-of-winning-ai-race/5206995\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.c-span.org/clip/united-nations/president-trump-renames-ai-to-super-intelligence-and-stresses-importance-of-winning-ai-race/5206995</a></p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 1, "score_up": 9, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVQtWWY4", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 9, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8855590, "raw_content": "", "author": "Trick", "created": 1790351601841, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "www.thegatewaypundit.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVQtWWY4.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://www.thegatewaypundit.com/2026/09/enes-freedom-is-male-so-why-cant-he/", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Enes Freedom Is Male. So Why Can\u2019t He Play for the WNBA?", "last_comment_created": 1790351601841, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false